 27 | //   - READC iterates changed subfile rows (rows where operator typed options).
 28 | //   - MSGCTL uses OVERLAY so FOOTER (lines 22-23) persists across EXFMT.
 29 | //   - QCMDEXC prototype uses OPTIONS(*VARSIZE) so RPG passes exactly the
 30 | //     trimmed command length rather than a padded 32702-byte buffer.
